{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/turn-base-fighting-game-factor-d.png?t=1742006236\" />D-FACTOR Features innovative gameplay with a FIGHTING GAME visualization and fast-paced turn-based gameplay. Enjoy its incredible MANGA-style illustrations, finish the game with each character to discover part of their story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/Combates_por_turnos_factor_D_indie_video_Game.gif?t=1742006236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/12-characters.png?t=1742006236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select one of 12 playable characters to unlock their endings and hidden characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/Seleccion_de_personajes.gif?t=1742006236\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game design with MANGA style!! not comic!! SLEEVE!! to the Japanese</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frantic gameplay!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 characters to select!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 game modes, NORMAL or SPECIAL</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Difficulties, NORMAL or DIFFICULT</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters to unlock</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/juego-frenetico.png?t=1742006236\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/AiSuper.gif?t=1742006236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/J_SUPER.gif?t=1742006236\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY AND SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In STORY mode, you face enemies one-on-one in turn-based combat. In SURVIVE, you must move around the map collecting cards to improve your stats; bosses are defeated in turns.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 unique ability for each character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super attacks for each character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haruky has a transformation and a new final boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Mini Game Mode\u00a0SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the waves of enemies to face the bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat bosses in classic mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887360/extras/Factor-D-steam-minigame.gif?t=1742006236\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1000 Golpes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1887360/848e9cb0b26d1821c6dff6c4a0745ee70968bc24.jpg"},{"name":"Final de Slime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1887360/bc3f7934e0298710994f229056a349e05710eb93.jpg"},{"name":"Final de Trinity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1887360/a4ef23ac207cc80380de96718c9560a22131f225.jpg"},{"name":"Final de Sombras","path":"